[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0528","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1403","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla 权限提升漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，用户名和密码被直接包含在 URL 中。远程攻击者可通过读取 Web 服务器日志文件获取这些凭证，或通过肩窥（shoulder-surfing）观察浏览器地址栏直接窃取登录信息，从而获得系统管理员权限。该漏洞影响所有 Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1403"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14 或更高版本（2.14 已修复密码出现在 URL 中的问题）。升级后运行 checksetup.pl 完成数据库迁移，并确保 Apache 已启用 .htaccess（checksetup.pl 默认生成）以阻止对 data/ 目录和 localconfig 文件的未授权访问。同时清理现有 Web 服务器日志中可能已泄露的 URL 记录，并强制所有用户修改密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=15980","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99912899900567","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-107.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1403","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7m8v-g3cq-39vj/GHSA-7m8v-g3cq-39vj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1403.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89609/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1403.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dadfe5be-95de-407d-8553-2fd857f88f9b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0528.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0527","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1402","title":"Bugzilla Bugzilla 跨站脚本和SQL注入漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）和 SQL 注入漏洞。由于程序未正确转义不受信任的参数，远程攻击者可通过向 reports.cgi 的 product/output 变量、showvotes.cgi 的 voteon/bug_id/user 变量、createaccount.cgi 的无效邮箱地址、showdependencytree.cgi 的无效 ID、process_bug.cgi 的无效用户名等字段以及 buglist.cgi 的错误消息中注入恶意脚本或 SQL 语句，实现任意 Web 脚本执行或数据库操作。该漏洞影响所有使用 Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本的服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1402"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14 或更高版本，该版本已修复对不可信参数的正确转义处理。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2001-107 提供的补丁包。临时缓解措施包括在 Web 应用防火墙中过滤 reports.cgi、showvotes.cgi、createaccount.cgi、process_bug.cgi 等页面的特殊字符输入，并对所有用户输入进行 HTML 编码输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=38854","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=38855","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=38859","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39536","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=87701","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=95235","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99912899900567","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-107.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1402.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1402","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1402.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1402.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4m9f-r2j3-9f9c/GHSA-4m9f-r2j3-9f9c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1402.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82921/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae72b976-bbb8-48ad-958e-7674bcccca6e.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1402.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0525","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1401","title":"Bugzilla 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本存在安全绕过漏洞，由于对机密 bug 的访问权限控制不严，远程攻击者可通过向 process_bug.cgi、show_activity.cgi、showvotes.cgi、showdependencytree.cgi、showdependencygraph.cgi、showattachment.cgi 或 describecomponents.cgi 等脚本发送特制的 bug id 参数，绕过查看权限限制，越权访问本应受限的机密漏洞信息，导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞影响所有 Bugzilla 2.14 之前版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1401"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:12Z","remediation":"升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过修改 process_bug.cgi、show_activity.cgi 等 CGI 参数绕过权限检查的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache/Nginx）对上述 CGI 脚本添加访问控制，限制仅授权用户可访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39524","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39526","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39527","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39531","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=39533","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=70189","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=82781","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99912899900567","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-107.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1401","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1401.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1401.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v4p6-22jc-3v6h/GHSA-v4p6-22jc-3v6h.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1401.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89634/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ede85af0-5454-4efd-bbe5-862be1f57d32.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1401.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0457","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0457.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1093","title":"Digital UNIX msgchk 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Digital UNIX 4.0G 及更早版本中的 msgchk 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。msgchk 在处理超长命令行参数时未正确检查缓冲区边界，导致栈溢出。本地攻击者可通过向 msgchk 程序传递特制的超长命令行参数触发该漏洞，覆盖返回地址，从而以目标进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Digital UNIX 4.0G 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的利用代码，攻击者无需身份认证即可在本地利用此漏洞完全控制系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1093"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:34Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 Digital UNIX（Tru64 UNIX）4.0G 及更早版本，厂商 Compaq/HP 已停止对该产品的安全支持，不再提供官方补丁。建议立即将系统迁移至受支持的操作系统平台（如 HP-UX 或 Linux）；若无法迁移，应限制本地用户对 msgchk 二进制文件的访问权限（如 chmod 750 /usr/bin/msgchk），并移除 msgchk 的 setuid 位以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/213238","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3311","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7101","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21105","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1093.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1093","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1093.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1093.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3486-w28q-g6jc/GHSA-3486-w28q-g6jc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3311/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1093.json","https://github.com/truefinder/truefinder/blob/02568a5b230d1ea29e368cc8af0beaaf49c4f1ac/README.md","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0457.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0456","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0456.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1092","title":"Compaq Digital UNIX msgchk 符号链接漏洞","description":"Digital UNIX（Tru64 UNIX）4.0G 及更早版本中的 msgchk 工具存在符号链接漏洞。msgchk 在读取用户 MH 邮件配置文件 .mh_profile 时未对符号链接进行安全检查，攻击者可在本地创建一个将 .mh_profile 指向任意目标文件的符号链接，当受害者执行 msgchk 命令时，程序会跟随该符号链接读取目标文件内容，导致攻击者能够获取目标文件的第一行数据。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，攻击条件为攻击者可在 msgchk 用户的主目录下创建符号链接，利用方式简单，属于低危信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1092"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:34Z","remediation":"由于 msgchk 以 setuid root 权限运行时可通过 .mh_profile 符号链接读取任意文件首行，请立即使用 chmod 命令移除 /usr/bin/mh/msgchk 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/mh/msgchk），以消除提权风险。同时审查所有用户主目录，删除指向敏感文件的 .mh_profile 符号链接（find ~ -name .mh_profile -type l -delete）。长期方案为将系统从 Digital Unix 4.0G 升级至 Tru64 UNIX 5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复此符号链接漏洞。如无法升级操作系统，可考虑禁用 MH 邮件系统或限制 msgchk 的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/440539","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/213238","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3320","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7102","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21107","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1092.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1092","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1092.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gjvx-vv98-2m3q/GHSA-gjvx-vv98-2m3q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1092.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3320/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cdc426d1-5930-404e-a97f-fc5092ca9129.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1092.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0456.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0430","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0430.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0985","title":"Hassan Consulting Shopping Cart 1.23 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Hassan Consulting Shopping Cart 1.23 的 shop.pl 脚本存在任意命令执行漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 \"page\" 参数注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）实现任意系统命令执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击者可借此完全控制目标服务器，获取敏感数据或植入后门。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0985"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 Hassan Consulting Shopping Cart 至 1.34 或更高版本（1.34 已包含安全修复，1.40 进一步增强了安全性）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache）层面通过 mod_rewrite 或 mod_security 规则过滤 shop.pl 的 page 参数中的 shell 元字符（| ; ` $ 等），或限制 /cgi-local/ 目录仅允许 GET 请求并禁用 CGI 脚本的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.irata.com/shopver.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/212827","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3308","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7106","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0985.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0985","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0985.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0985.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8c3m-wwrj-jg5f/GHSA-8c3m-wwrj-jg5f.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0985.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0985.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/shopping_cart_information_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0430.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0470","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1138","title":"Randy Parker Power Up HTML 目录遍历任意文件泄露漏洞","description":"Power Up HTML 0.8033 Beta 中的 r.pl（又名 r.cgi）脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FILE 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，甚至可能结合文件包含等方式实现远程代码执行。攻击无需身份认证，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1138"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:39Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Power Up HTML 0.8033 Beta 及更早版本，该软件已停止维护且无官方补丁。彻底解决方案：从 Web 服务器上删除 `/cgi-bin/powerup/` 目录及所有相关 CGI 脚本，迁移至其他受支持的 Web 应用框架。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中对 `r.cgi` 路径添加访问控制，仅允许授权 IP 访问；或在反向代理层过滤包含 `../` 的 `FILE` 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/212679","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3304","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21102","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1138","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1138.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1138.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37mh-6cwh-pwc5/GHSA-37mh-6cwh-pwc5.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/powerup_information_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3304/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1138.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0436","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1000","title":"Merit AAA RADIUS Server rlmadmin 符号链接漏洞","description":"Merit AAA RADIUS Server 3.8M、5.01 及可能其他版本中的 rlmadmin RADIUS 管理工具存在符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 rlmadmin.help 文件上创建符号链接，诱使程序读取任意系统文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响本地用户权限范围内的文件读取。厂商 Merit 至今未发布官方补丁，建议限制本地用户对 rlmadmin 工具的访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1000"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:23Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 rlmadmin 管理工具以 setuid root 运行且未校验帮助文件是否为符号链接，导致本地用户可读取任意系统文件（如 /etc/shadow）。建议立即移除 rlmadmin 的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/private/etc/rlmadmin；同时限制可执行目录权限为仅 root 可访问：chmod 700 /usr/private/etc。如业务允许，建议迁移至 FreeRADIUS 等仍在维护的 RADIUS 服务器替代 Merit AAA Server。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0036.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3302","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7096","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21101","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1000.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1000","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1000.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1000.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-26f7-xg4p-fj4g/GHSA-26f7-xg4p-fj4g.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1000.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3302/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0436.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0436.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0496","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1378","title":"fetchmail fetchmailconf 符号链接漏洞","description":"fetchmail 5.7.4 之前版本中的 fetchmailconf 配置工具在创建临时文件时存在不安全的符号链接处理漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者可通过在临时文件目录中创建恶意符号链接，利用 fetchmailconf 对临时文件的操作权限，将文件写入或覆盖其他用户的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序使用可预测的临时文件名且未进行安全校验，攻击者无需认证即可在本地系统上实施攻击，导致受影响用户的文件完整性被破坏。由于攻击需要本地访问权限且仅影响文件完整性，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1378"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:09Z","remediation":"升级 fetchmail 至 5.7.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 fetchmailconf 临时文件创建时的竞态条件问题。如无法立即升级，可移除 fetchmailconf 的 setuid 权限或限制其可执行用户范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.ccil.org/pipermail/fetchmail-announce/2001-March/000015.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-103.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/