至 V2.56b6 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙配置规则过滤畸形 IP 分片报文，或禁用受影响设备的公网访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/212532","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3306","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7090","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1137","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1137.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5mg5-x2jj-445c/GHSA-5mg5-x2jj-445c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3306/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1137.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0469.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0469.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0428","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0428.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0979","title":"HP-UX swverify 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 及 11.11 系统中的 swverify 及其他相关程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向命令行参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.0 和 11.11 版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码（EDB-ID: 482），攻击者可通过编译执行该 PoC 实现本地权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0979"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 官方安全补丁（参考 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX0201-179），升级 swinstall/swverify 至修复版本。如无法打补丁，可移除 swverify 和 swinstall 的 SUID 位（chmod 755 /usr/sbin/swverify /usr/sbin/swinstall），限制本地普通用户执行这些特权程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/211687","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3279","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7078","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/482","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0979.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0979","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0979.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0979.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-376m-3h9j-6rv5/GHSA-376m-3h9j-6rv5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0979.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0979.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--79445e11-670b-4b61-9fe6-9662c6af197f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0428.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0447","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1067","title":"AOL AOLserver 3.0 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AOLserver 3.0 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 Authorization 头的特制 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝响应，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AOLserver 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1067"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 AOLserver 至 4.0 或更高版本（3.4+ 已修复该漏洞），或迁移至 Apache/Nginx 等仍在维护的 Web 服务器。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面限制 HTTP Authorization 头长度不超过 1024 字节，并监控 80 端口异常超长请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-08/0325.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/213041","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3230","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7030","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21089","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1067.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1067","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1067.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1067.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v3g6-4fj9-h2hr/GHSA-v3g6-4fj9-h2hr.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1067.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151400_151500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--444947e7-7a2e-48cf-99ce-13acda6b6422.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1067.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0447.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0447.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0446","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1064","title":"Cisco CBOS HTTP/Telnet服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco 600 系列路由器上运行的 CBOS 固件 2.0.1 至 2.4.2ap 版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向路由器的 HTTP 或 Telnet 服务发起大量并发 TCP 连接，耗尽路由器系统资源，导致设备完全无响应并停止转发数据包。攻击无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送大量连接请求即可触发，影响范围包括使用 CBOS 固件的 Cisco 600 系列路由器设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1064"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:30Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco CBOS 至 2.4.2ap 之后的安全版本（如 2.4.3 或更高），该版本已修复 HTTP/Telnet 服务因大量并发连接导致拒绝服务的问题。如无法立即升级，可在路由器访问控制列表（ACL）中限制对 HTTP（80/TCP）和 Telnet（23/TCP）端口的源 IP 范围，仅允许受信任的管理地址访问，并配置连接数限制以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/cisco-cbos-webserver-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3236","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7025","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7026","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1064.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1064.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1064","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1064.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1064.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3f6g-q6j8-gjpg/GHSA-3f6g-q6j8-gjpg.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c82d941-daf9-4a80-af01-4550a0fa35ac.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3236/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0442","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0442.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1036","title":"GNU findutils locate 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"GNU findutils 中的 locate 命令在处理旧格式文件名数据库（locatedb）时存在内存写入漏洞。当 locatedb 文件中包含越界偏移量的条目时，locate 会向任意进程内存写入数据，导致本地攻击者可利用精心构造的 locatedb 文件触发该漏洞，从而提升权限至 root。该漏洞影响 Slackware 7.1 和 8.0 系统上的 findutils 4.1 版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限并能够控制 locatedb 文件内容。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1036"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 GNU findutils 至 4.1.20 或更高版本（ftp.gnu.org/gnu/findutils/ 可下载），该版本修复了 locate 处理旧格式 locatedb 时越界偏移写入任意进程内存的问题。Slackware 用户应升级至 7.1/8.0 之后的安全更新版本。临时缓解措施：限制普通用户对 locatedb 数据库文件的写入权限，并确保数据库仅由受信进程生成。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/5477","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/200991","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3127","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6932","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21043","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2007/CVE-2007-2452.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1036","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1036.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1036.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4846-269g-37mp/GHSA-4846-269g-37mp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1036.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2007-2452","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2007/CVE-2007-2452.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--da1756fe-878c-4f1f-85a9-c4db0b45cdfa.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0442.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0437","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1003","title":"Respondus for WebCT 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"Respondus for WebCT 1.1.2 存在弱密码加密漏洞。该软件在存储用户凭据时使用弱加密算法对用户名和密码进行编码，本地攻击者若能读取 WEBCT.SVR 配置文件，即可通过逆向弱加密算法解密其中的密码信息，从而获取其他用户的登录凭据并提升权限。攻击者需要具有本地文件读取权限，攻击复杂度较低，影响系统的机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1003"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:23Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Respondus 至 1.1.2 以上版本（厂商已在后续版本中修复弱加密问题）。如无法升级，应严格限制 WEBCT.SVR 文件的访问权限，仅允许 WebCT 服务进程读取，并定期清理该文件中的缓存凭据。同时建议启用 WebCT 的操作系统级文件审计日志，监控对 WEBCT.SVR 的异常访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99859557930285&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21078","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1003.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1003","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1003.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1003.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g8jg-wcrf-374h/GHSA-g8jg-wcrf-374h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1003.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalys